	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 伝説のジェダイ・マスター「ヨーダ」が、大好評の1/6スケールで登場！",
			"• ヨーダ専用のライトセーバーや杖、さまざまなシーン再現を可能にする多彩なハンドパーツなど、豊富なオプションパーツが付属。",
			"• ローブの下半分は軟質素材を採用し、広い可動域を実現。",
			"• 頭部は、頭部再現Ver.と髪の毛再現Ver.の2種が付属。さらに視線の向きもパーツで選択可能！",
			"• クラシックファンからの人気が高い『エピソード５／帝国の逆襲』版のヨーダが1/12スケールの固定ポーズモデルとして付属！",
			"• 同じ1/12スケールのR2-D2（別売）と並べて、惑星ダゴバのシーンを再現可能！",
			"• 全高約110mm。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The legendary Jedi Master \"Yoda\" is now available in the popular 1/6 Scale!",
			"• A wide variety of optional parts are included, including Yoda's own lightsaber, cane, and a variety of hand parts that allow you to recreate various scenes.",
			"• The lower half of the robe is made of soft material, allowing for a wide range of motion.",
			"• Two types of heads are included: a head reproduction version and a hair reproduction version. Furthermore, the direction of the line of sight can also be selected by parts!",
			"• Yoda from \"Episode 5: The Empire Strikes Back\", which is popular among classic fans, is included as a 1/12 scale fixed pose model!",
			"• You can recreate the scene of the planet Dagobah by placing it side by side with the same 1/12 Scale R2-D2 (sold separately)!",
			"• Overall height approximately 110mm."
		]
	},
